{{also|Fragen}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|vrāgen|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|frāgēn|lang=goh}}, {{term|frahen|frahēn/frāhēn|lang=goh}}, which is indirectly derived from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*fregnaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*preḱ-||to ask}}.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=Frage, fragen}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|De-fragen.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|/ˈfʁaːgən/|[ˈfʁaːgŋ]|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|aːgn̩|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|fra|gen}}

===Verb===
{{head|de|verb|third-person singular present|fragt|or|frägt|past tense|fragte|or|frug|past participle|gefragt}}


# to [[ask]]

====Conjugation====
The strong conjugation of {{term|fragen}} has been build in analogy to verbs like {{term|tragen}}. The strong forms remain resticted to certain dialects.

